  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p><strong>None.</strong> Better Buy Calculator does not require an account and does not collect personal information or any other user data.</p>

  <h2>How the App Works</h2>
  <p>Better Buy Calculator performs package-price calculations on your iPhone. It has no backend and does not connect to the internet. It does not retain your comparisons or other user data.</p>

  <h2>Tracking, Analytics, and Third Parties</h2>
  <p>Better Buy Calculator does not use analytics, tracking, advertising, third-party runtime SDKs, or third-party services. It does not transmit or share data with anyone.</p>

  <h2>Device Access</h2>
  <p>Better Buy Calculator does not request device permissions.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>Any future changes to this policy will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:matt@mattdonders.com?subject=Better%20Buy%20Calculator%20Privacy">matt@mattdonders.com</a>.</p>
